# Testing a build
@scenario tutorial_lesson_16
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg room]
[char ginger global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show ginger guide normal]
ginger: Let's send this scene to a friend. Will the chime still play when my project folder is nowhere nearby?
ginger: Export the project. Launch the build outside the project folder and play the sound effects example.
> Review question -> check
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label check
ginger: Which check exercises the files your audience receives?
> Play only from the editor. -> retry
> Run the exported package. -> correct
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label retry
[show ginger guide sad]
ginger: A packaged run resolves assets through the shipped project. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show ginger guide normal]
ginger: A packaged run resolves assets through the shipped project.
> Back to topics -> return_hub
> Replay example -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_16]
[flag tutorial_done_16]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_6]
